    "sections": {
        "description": "Charity Grove is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme designed for NGOs, INGOs, fundraising organizations, charity events, business firms, and law firms. Built with the Gutenberg block editor, it allows complete site customization including headers, footers, templates, and layouts without coding. Charity Grove is fully WooCommerce compatible, making it easy to collect donations, sell products, and manage payments. The theme is fast, SEO-friendly, mobile-responsive, and comes with a clean, professional design, making it an ideal solution for creating a powerful and trustworthy online presence. Demo: https://demos.themegrove.com/charity-grove/"
    },
